 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "The board holds a..y row by row in five columns and z alone at row 5, column 0. Starting on \"a\", spell word (lowercase letters) by moving one cell at a time and pressing \"!\" on each letter. Return the move string: for each letter, \"U\" times the rows to go up, then \"L\" times the columns to go left, then \"D\" times the rows to go down, then \"R\" times the columns to go right, then \"!\". This order is a shortest path that never leaves the board.",
